      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This revised order follows a more natural progression—from concepts, to\narchitecture, installation, workloads, configuration, networking,\noperations, monitoring, a capstone mini project, and finally interview\npreparation—making it well suited for a 25–35 hour Kubernetes Foundation\ntraining program.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This revised order follows a more natural progression—from concepts, to architecture, installation, workloads, configuration, networking, operations, monitoring, a capstone mini project, and finally interview preparation—making it well suited for a 25–35 hour Kubernetes Foundation training program.",
